// Shard's item table, in the form `crcbl_inventory::Catalog::from_ron` reads.
//
// Five items, and between them they cover every shape the panel and the
// placement algorithm have to handle: a stacking 1x1, a plain 1x1, a 1x2, a
// solid 2x2 and an L that is not its own mirror. `docs/plan/34-inventory.md`'s
// container table is what the sizes are drawn from — the pocket is 1x2 and a
// helmet slot is 1x1 — and `crate::loot` is what turns a felled foe into one of
// these.
//
// `letter` and `colour` are the placeholder cell `apps/shard/src/panel.rs`
// draws. There is no icon atlas: `crcbl icon bake` is not a verb yet, and that
// plan's Presentation section is where it is owed.
